| Compile/Link  |                            | 5,352        | After all functions are compiled and linked into a single design                       |
|               |                            |              |                                                                                        |
| Unroll/Inline |                            |              | After user unroll and inline pragmas are applied                                       |
|               | (1) unroll                 | 1,976        | user unroll pragmas are applied                                                        |
|               | (2) simplification         | 1,448        | simplification of applied user unroll pragmas                                          |
|               | (3) inline                 | 1,489        | user inline pragmas are applied                                                        |
|               | (4) simplification         | 1,389        | simplification of applied user inline pragmas                                          |
|               |                            |              |                                                                                        |
| Array/Struct  |                            |              | After user array partition and struct aggregate/disaggregate pragmas are applied       |
|               | (1) array partition        | 1,065        | user array partition pragmas are applied                                               |
|               | (2) simplification         | 1,031        | simplification of applied user array partition & struct aggregate/disaggregate pragmas |
|               | (3) aggregate/disaggregate | 1,050        | user struct aggregate/disaggregate pragmas are applied                                 |
|               | (4) array reshape          | 1,253        | apply array reshape pragmas                                                            |
|               | (5) access patterns        | 1,445        | array access pattern optmizations                                                      |
|               |                            |              |                                                                                        |
| Performance   |                            |              | After transformations are applied to meet performance pragma targets                   |
|               | (1) loop simplification    | 1,358        | loop and instruction simplification                                                    |
|               | (2) parallelization        | 1,293        | loops are unrolled or pipelined to meet performance targets                            |
|               | (3) array partition        | 1,198        | arrays are partitioned to meet performance targets                                     |
|               | (4) simplification         | 1,198        | simplification of design after performance transformations                             |
|               |                            |              |                                                                                        |
| HW Transforms |                            |              | After hardware transfomations                                                          |
|               | (1) lowering               | 1,205        | initial conversion to HW specific instructions                                         |
|               | (2) optimizations          | 1,203        | high level synthesis optimizations                                                     |
